  "description": "Medicare coverage guidelines for endovascular abdominal aortic aneurysm repair (EVAR). Requires infrarenal abdominal aortic aneurysm measuring >= 5.5 cm in men or >= 5.0 cm in women, or rapid expansion rate > 0.5 cm in 6 months, with suitable landing zone anatomy on CT angiography.",
